        "message_id_md5": "f3eb0478d02549f401755aef66b2eeea",
        "in_reply_to": null,
        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div>\n<p>Dear Avicenna sales team,</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>We would like to connect the following study to our license at the University of Innsbruck (psychology department).</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Study-ID: 4096</p>\n<p>How much licenses should be allocated: 400</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>How long is each individual participant part of the study: up to 14 days</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>How long does data collection last for the whole study: Starting from 28.10.2024 until 10.11.2024</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Short description of the study:</p>\n<p>We will conduct a daily diary study over one workweek. To collect data, participants fill in four questionnaires per day in an interval-contingent design to assess job stressors and well-being indicators Furthermore we investigate more precisely when TASW takes place, by establishing an event-contingent diary design, where participants answer questions about their TASW behavior.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Thank you in advance,</p>\n<p>Best regards,</p>\n<p>Yashvin</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>",
